# db-services

All Postgres lives in `@namma-medmate/db-services` (Drizzle schema, repositories, services). Module APIs import the lib. No `modules/*/api/db/`.

Pharmacy rows store `tenant_id` + `location_id`. UUIDs for ids.

```ts
// BAD
// modules/tenancy/api/src/db/pharmacies.ts
await pool.query('SELECT * FROM pharmacies WHERE tenant_id = $1', [id]);

// GOOD
import { getLocationForTenant } from '@namma-medmate/db-services';
```
